sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 27
    actor M as Manager
    participant UI as :ConsoleUI
    participant G as :Game
    participant W as waiter:Waiter
    participant C as chef:Chef
    participant P as :PricingPolicy
    participant HH as :HappyHour
    participant R as :Restaurant
    participant V as chloe:VIPCustomer
    participant O as :Order

    Note over M,O: Part 2 of 6. Turn 7 continued: Chloe orders while Happy Hour is on, the Chef starts cooking, and the turn ends.

    loop for turn = 1 to 18, while not game.isOver()
        M->>UI: "order 3"
        UI->>+G: direct(waiter, cmd)
        G->>+W: perform(cmd, ctx)
        W->>W: carryOut(cmd, ctx)
        W->>W: takeOrder(chloe, ctx)
        W->>V: chooseFrom(menu)
        V-->>W: Pasta
        W->>+P: quote(chloe, Pasta, 7)
        P->>V: billFor($18.00)
        V-->>P: $16.20 (VIP 10% off)
        loop for each PriceModifier
            P->>HH: adjust($16.20, 7)
            HH-->>P: $12.96 (Happy Hour 20% off)
        end
        P-->>-W: $12.96
        W->>R: placeOrder(chloe, Pasta, $12.96, 7)
        R->>O: «create» Order(chloe, Pasta, $12.96, 7)
        R->>V: placeOrder(order)
        W-->>-G: ActionResult.done
        G-->>-UI: ActionResult.done
        Note over P,O: Price locked at $12.96. Without the Happy Hour choice (message 9) it would be $16.20.
        M->>UI: "cook 3"
        UI->>+G: direct(chef, cmd)
        G->>+C: perform(cmd, ctx)
        C->>C: carryOut(cmd, ctx)
        C->>O: prepareUnit(7)
        Note over O: 1 of 2 units done
        C-->>-G: ActionResult.done
        G-->>-UI: ActionResult.done
        UI->>+G: endTurn()
        Note over G,V: step 4: nobody finishes eating or pays this turn
        loop step 5: for each customer in awaitingService()
            G->>V: loseSatisfaction()
        end
        Note over V: VIP loses 5: 100 to 95 (Ben, a Critic, loses 12)
        G-->>-UI: events
    end
